              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Machine Curse" id="9932-7382-29b3-3f6b" hidden="false">
              <description>Make the Psychic test at the start of the Assault phase. If passed the power is effective until the end of the same Assault phase. Make one close combat attack against a vehicle in base contact with the Psyker. If a hit is scored, roll a D6:
1 - 3: No effect
4 - 5: Inflict Glancing Hit
6 : Inflict Penetrating Hit</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
